[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SVD (Software Version Description)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Software Version Description
STATEMENT: The system shall maintain version control with clear identification of software releases.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVD-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Version Management
STATEMENT: The system shall implement semantic versioning with major, minor, and patch version numbers.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVD-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Release Notes
STATEMENT: The system shall provide comprehensive release notes documenting changes and new features.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVD-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Deployment Instructions
STATEMENT: The system shall provide clear deployment instructions for each software version.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.